WEBVTT

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:14.360
In the city watched over by aliens,

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.620
a certain girl was sending radio waves around the world.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:22.620
"Beep beep beep," she went.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.000
"Beep beep beep, beep beep beep,"

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:29.940
as she chased the distant Universe.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:34.010
Chapter 1
City of Aliens

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.570
A foolish eleventh grader

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:46.690
Looking up to the sky above this city all by herself

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:50.320
School skipper wearing pajamas

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:53.620
Drops out before the summer break

00:00:53.620 --> 00:01:00.370
Even if my nickname is "alien" on Earth

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:05.960
Freakier weirdos like you

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:11.180
were there in an outer space waiting room

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.570
When I tried to connect to you,

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:17.930
to check your reception

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:20.980
You were there staring in awe,

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:24.650
while others veered away

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:28.180
Even if my telepathy is sending feelings

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:31.490
on the wrong frequency

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:34.910
I'm sure something is reaching you

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:37.760
That's why I love you

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:51.840
I'm wondering if you're receiving my signals

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:57.970
I love you for staying with me no matter what

00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:02.850
I'm sure only you can receive my signals

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.680
Excuse me.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:16.040
Here.

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:17.550
Ah, thanks.

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:20.950
Plus one point.

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:23.810
Sorry.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.120
Minus one.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:28.370
My high school life last year, minus three.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:32.380
I bid farewell to the land where I spent the first fifteen years of my life.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:34.930
Like one of those protagonists in high school dramas,

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:36.760
my parents went to work abroad,

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:41.760
and I was sent to live with my aunt during my final two years of high school.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.640
Passengers in a hurry, please head to the other side of...

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:45.950
And now, I feel like I'm on top of the world!
Passengers in a hurry, please head to the other side of...

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:48.340
And now, I feel like I'm on top of the world!

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.360
My new school is in the city,

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:52.900
so there will be at least ten girls in my class!

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:53.960
Energy-saving Revolution

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.980
I'm told that my aunt isn't married and doesn't have any kids.
Energy-saving Revolution

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:56.630
I'm told that my aunt isn't married and doesn't have any kids.

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:59.720
Not only that, she works. Well, of course she does.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:02.610
In other words, I might as well be living alone!

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:10.970
An enthralling environment that will strip a rebellious 11th grader of his meager allowance and what little pride he has.

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:14.740
There must be a mischievous Shenlong on my side.

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:19.300
So much for the proper upbringing that parents wish for their adolescent sons.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:24.660
This sense of transcendence...

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:30.170
It's similar to the ecstasy you get when your tension melts away after finishing your exams.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:32.460
Is this the sensation of being rocked by waves,

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.400
evoked by semicircular canal impairment?

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.500
We are arriving at the next station. The doors will open on the left.
evoked by semicircular canal impairment?

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:42.860
We are arriving at the next station. The doors will open on the left.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:46.780
Please watch your step when you exit. Thank you.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.540
South Exit -North Exit

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:57.980
Like I'd be able to recognize her...

00:03:57.980 --> 00:03:59.260
Makoto-kun?

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.180
You're Makoto-kun, right?

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:08.490
Ah, yes. I'm the Niwa Makoto you speak of.

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:10.170
Hello, hello.

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:12.430
Uh, I'll be in your care for a while.

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:14.560
How awkward...

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:17.310
Likewise, okay?

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:20.740
Oh, I should give you my business card.

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.740
I'm Touwa Meme!

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:23.650
Thank you.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.160
Touwa Meme, 39 Years Old

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:28.410
What a strange name.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:32.220
Is it a stage name, trade name, ring name, or an alias?

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:35.670
It's unlikely, but it could also be a pseudonym for your alternate personality.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:38.440
It happens to be my real name!

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:39.740
Touwa Meme.

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:42.920
Feel free to call me Jojo!

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.790
Is my high school close by?

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:48.710
Let's see. It takes me about fifteen minutes on bicycle.

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:51.310
You could probably get there quicker.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.890
Hey!

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:00.930
Why did she sit in front?

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:10.390
Everything in the city seems to be made of steel.

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:14.720
It sure beats the dusty countryside!

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:21.420
Welcome to the city watched over by aliens.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:22.300
<b>Welcome to the city
watched by aliens</b>

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.910
Ah, did that creep you out?

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:28.850
We get a lot of UFO sightings around here.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:30.550
I guess it's like Florida.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:31.830
Right.

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:36.560
Could she be an alien fanatic or even an MMR conspiracy theorist?

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:42.230
All right! Welcome to your second home.

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:44.420
Thank you for your accommodation.

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.450
Thanks for staying with us!

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:47.950
I'm really sorry, thanks.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:49.320
Huh?

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:51.530
I'm home!

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:03.570
I tidied up the house, so come on in.

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.670
Sorry about the cramped rooms, though!

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:09.390
Wait a second. Before you put on your slippers, and before your refreshing smile,

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:12.660
there's a matter of grave concern, right by your feet!

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:16.680
Lying inside the entryway to the warm home that I'll walk through every day...

00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:20.480
is that fish roll... thing.

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:26.610
Hmm?

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:31.890
Are you holding back out of courtesy? Such formalities are...

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.250
no good!

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.810
Oh? Was that out of character?

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:41.940
Well, yes.

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:43.300
That's just fine!

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:45.580
I'm going for the "gap moe" character.

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:47.410
Do you know what "moe" is?

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:49.090
Um, I guess so.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:53.390
It's like an old lady who can manhandle Rikidouzan!

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:55.210
That's not what it means!

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:57.390
I pity myself for contributing to this comedy sketch.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:00.360
Your room is the first one upstairs.

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:02.270
Let me know if anything's bothering you.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:04.510
You really want me to spit it out?

00:07:04.510 --> 00:07:07.080
I'll cut to the chase and begin the machine gun talk, damn it!

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:11.200
I'm more than happy just to live here with you!

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:15.360
What was with that human futon roll?

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:16.590
What's her deal?

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:17.580
Ow!

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.830
I went all out today!

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:23.300
Oh...

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:27.370
I probably can't make it home for dinner with you on weekdays.

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:29.790
Makoto-kun, can you cook?

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:32.220
Well, as long as it doesn't require a knife...

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.470
Just like a typical boy!

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:37.940
Why are you peeking around?

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:40.600
Am I not supposed to see it,
or am I not supposed to look?

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.910
There's a distracting object to my right.

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:45.860
They say ghosts always appear from your left!

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:51.290
I didn't bring this up to discuss science and spirituality over dinner.

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:55.420
Very well, I don't like roundabout conversations, so I'll be blunt.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:56.370
You're proposing to me?

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.870
No one mentioned anything about Hyacinths!

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.190
You've been lying to me!

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:04.590
"Mokoto-kun exposes a lie."

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:06.840
Wouldn't that look so cool on paper?

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.250
Oh, that's true. Wait.

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:11.720
You don't live alone!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:13.600
Wh-What?

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:14.930
What's the matter with you?

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:18.420
I'm so far past hungry now that I'm all fed up!

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:22.670
You must have endured for so long that you got a stomach cramp!

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.420
Do you have proof that I'm lying?

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:27.900
Proof?

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.680
Here's the proof.

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:33.060
Oh, my!

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:36.230
I'm sick of this roundabout conversation. What is this?

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:40.290
A roundabout approach must be taken to explain that.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.810
Fine, please explain... this thing.

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:49.480
At the dawn of 20th century, a black cloud was floating over a rural town in the USA-

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:51.080
Without the exposition, please.

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:53.310
It must be nice to be young.

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:57.370
Your adolescence means people will encourage you to be enthusiastic.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:09:02.710
People were repulsed when <i>I</i> got too enthused about a clearance item at the supermarket.

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:05.610
I think the problem was your bloodshot eyes.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:12.440
Anyway, it doesn't matter if eggplants are ¥15 a bag or if ground meat is on sale for a limited time.

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:12.870
The problem is-

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:14.110
Your meal is getting cold!
The problem is-

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:16.750
Makkyun, eat up already!

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:18.800
Shut it! What dialect was that?!

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:20.990
Ow!

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:28.390
That was classified as a level-4 hostile contact,

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:30.800
and activated my defensive mechanism.

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:32.370
Huh?

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:42.880
Members of the self-unaware, mindless herd of subjects under observation are not permitted to touch me.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:48.800
A collective of protein that has forgotten it is a primitive collective...

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:50.400
That is you.

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.330
Excuse me, please translate.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:55.450
She's saying, "Nice to meet you."

00:09:56.240 --> 00:10:01.450
She has godly translation skills, considering she's not actually listening.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:04.200
This is my daughter, Touwa Erio.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:05.300
Daughter?

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:06.710
What do you mean by "daughter"?

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:07.720
<i>My daughter</i>.

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:10.960
It's difficult arguing with that, but please elaborate.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.040
And <i>you're</i> a virgin.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:16.350
Shut up, there's no opportunity in the countryside.

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:18.290
What happened to living alone?

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:22.870
My behavior since meeting you has been consistent with someone living alone.

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:24.980
Uh... um...

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:26.230
Do you have a problem with that?

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:28.300
Well...

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:29.980
Why do you pretend not to see her?

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:34.340
In any case, you're annoying!

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.130
The panties of a futon are just a part of its cloth.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.530
Damn it, this is wrong. Something about this is <i>not</i> right!

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:50.620
Hey, Makotocchi...

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:51.600
"Chi?"

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:55.140
The late husband's name is George, and his wife's name is Maria.

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:58.390
Let's not continue with the chitchat as if nothing happened.

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:02.260
Aha, we've completely broken the ice!

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.140
That we did.

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:08.530
The two of us will have a blast living together as family!

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:09.400
Two of us?

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:11.460
<i>One, two.</i>

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:13.100
What about that croissant-shaped thing?

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:16.090
Oh, that? Don't mind it!

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:18.010
What kind of mother are you?

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:19.920
What about your husband, then?

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:21.480
Oh, George?

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:23.420
When did you turn into Maria?

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:30.330
Injection of corrective program to primeval sinners with inflated egos and lust!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:56.930
Despite the major problem still left unsolved,

00:11:56.930 --> 00:12:01.240
school started the next day, and I became a transfer student.

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:37.180
Assessing my current situation objectively,

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:40.350
I'll be living under the same roof as a girl.

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:41.790
But still...

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:43.360
A fish roll has no gender.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:48.200
Whoa, is this thing still usable?

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:55.990
ASCII art?

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:58.390
My aunt put way too much energy into this.

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:04.390
<b>Niwa Makoto</b>

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:08.700
I'm Niwa Makoto. Uh... nice to meet you.
<b>Niwa Makoto</b>

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:09.110
<b>Niwa Makoto</b>

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:11.640
April marked the start of the new term.
<b>Niwa Makoto</b>

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:11.650
April marked the start of the new term.

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:16.420
A transfer student isn't seen as a big deal when it's the beginning of a new term.

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:26.080
I did a quick scan of the room for cute girls, and then homeroom ended.

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:31.080
I arrived home before noon.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.800
I need to send this out for maintenance soon.

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:38.830
Am I starting think that objects have souls?

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:41.090
I'm home!

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:47.850
The Universe has miscalculated the vectors.

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:49.770
She's a denpa.

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:50.980
Hey!

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:54.730
I have just returned home.

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:07.570
I'm Niwa Makoto.

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:09.230
I guess we're cousins.

00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:09.910
Nice to meet you.

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.000
The Earth is being targeted.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:14.910
Huh?

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:17.930
The Earth is being targeted!

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:21.430
The Earth is being targeted? Okay...

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:25.450
Fine, fine!

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:28.610
I don't even know how I'm supposed to comprehend that, but I agree!

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:29.850
Turn it back down.

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:36.680
Are you really my cousin?

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:39.650
Before that, are you really Meme-san's daughter?

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:43.480
Cousin: a child of one's uncle or aunt.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:46.310
It can refer to nephews and nieces.

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:50.310
It is also used to describe a person or thing related to another by similar nature.

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:55.680
Example: This loser in front of me has a face like the cousin of a water bear.

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:58.870
Don't degrade my face by pretending to recite from a dictionary.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.170
You've never even seen my face.

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.640
I see you don't intend to answer my questions.

00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:08.810
Anyway, we'll be living together for a while.

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:14.020
So, what are you doing here?

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:17.390
I'm awaiting matter transmission from the Universe.

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:19.400
Are you insane?

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:22.770
Two minutes and seven seconds until end of transmission.

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:26.500
Two minutes and seven seconds?

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:28.820
She pulled that out of thin air for sure.

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:31.910
Hello, it's Maul Maul Pizza.

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:34.100
How much is it?

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:35.710
¥1,400.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.830
That's a pretty common "universe", huh?

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.960
We had one of those in the countryside too.

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:46.580
The Universe is the closest thing mankind has to salvation.

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:51.370
Huh? "The Universe is the closest thing mankind has to salvation?"

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:53.380
Don't act as if you've summarized everything nicely.

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:55.020
That wasn't even a comeback.

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:58.590
Hey, walk slowly. It's dangerous.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.030
Whoa.

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:08.510
Thank you.

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:13.030
This denpa girl seems to understand the concept of money.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:17.790
Being able to order pizza is proof that she's capable of basic social interaction.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:21.170
Eating pizza while being rolled up in a futon

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:24.300
must be an impossible task even if she <i>is</i> a cosmic being wannabe.

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:28.000
What's inside is an Earthling bound by gravity, after all.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.670
In other words, she has to unwrap her futon.

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:31.530
Huh?

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:41.330
It was a method of nutrition intake far removed from any known dining etiquette.

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:45.860
What are you going to do with the rest?

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:49.940
Under the current assessment of the cousin, I wouldn't mind sharing.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.450
I'll split the cost, then.

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:58.870
Thanks.

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:11.740
Yes, hello? This is the Niwa residence.

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:14.010
Oh, honey! You're home already?

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:19.270
You're so mean, Shin-chan!

00:17:19.690 --> 00:17:21.020
Who are you calling "Shin-chan?"

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:23.680
Don't make it sound like I'm the child of a certain Nohara family!

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:26.320
You were like him when you were little.

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:27.780
Yeah, right!

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:29.870
Did you eat dinner yet?

00:17:29.870 --> 00:17:31.460
Not yet.

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:35.070
I can't come home yet, so just eat whatever you want.

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:38.810
Okay. What about your daughter?

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:42.990
It may be wise to pretend you never noticed her.

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:44.990
I can't do that.

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:48.170
Then it's up to you! I don't care!

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:54.310
Are you really her birth mother?

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:57.060
Hey, uh...

00:17:57.960 --> 00:17:59.640
What do you want for dinner?

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:01.230
What do you usually eat?

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:07.520
Normally, food transmitted from the Universe is
consumed as required nutrition for nighttime activities,

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:10.390
but as the source of nutrition was shared with the cousin today,

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:12.550
I am currently reducing my operational time.

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:16.620
Oh, you shared the pizza, so there's no dinner.

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:18.980
Fine, I'll cook.

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:22.420
Or should I go buy something, Sis?

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:26.920
The cousin is deemed incapable of executing supply replenishment to my satisfaction

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:33.180
since his assessment ability is
determined to be undeveloped.

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:45.130
She went crazy when I tried to take off her futon,

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:47.530
so I gave up and stuffed her in.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:52.930
If we run into a policeman devoted to protecting the neighborhood's peace,

00:18:52.930 --> 00:18:55.410
we'll surely be taken into custody.

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:58.700
I can only hope to be mistaken as a futon delivery man,

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.960
but this thing has legs.

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:04.260
How old is she? Does she even go to school?

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:06.550
She's suspicious in every way imaginable.

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:09.710
First of all, why don't any of my relatives know about her?

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:28.160
We're here!

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:29.970
I'm starving.

00:19:31.220 --> 00:19:34.350
The futon has to go if you're coming inside with me.

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:36.020
Wearing that is against the rules.

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:44.120
Public exposure could diminish the
impartiality of a class-2 investigator.

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:48.000
I see. I'm impressed by your sense of duty.

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:50.420
Stay here without making a scene.

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:55.840
However, the ability to adapt to a changing
environment is a sign of a first-rate investigator.

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:57.730
So you're saying...?

00:19:57.730 --> 00:20:01.060
My posterior must be removed from this basket!

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:12.360
You should just ask for help.

00:20:21.060 --> 00:20:23.360
Under the Moon, in its bright illumination,

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:27.620
stood something that seemed like an extraterrestrial life form.

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:31.280
What are you?

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:32.620
An alien?

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:35.010
A princess stuck in a bamboo stalk?

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:36.880
Alien!

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:37.890
Huh?

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:44.060
I'm... I'm...

00:20:45.420 --> 00:20:46.720
What? Hey!

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.140
... an alien!

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:57.210
Pizza toppings...

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:09.890
I want to reveal my secret to the cousin...

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:12.520
since you appear to have the potential.

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:14.590
Uh... what is it?

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:18.590
The Earth is being targeted.

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:23.460
I am an alien peacekeeper.

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:29.200
My two missions are to assess Earthlings as a whole by observing the residents of this city,

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:35.550
and to eradicate evidence of extraterrestrial contact on Earth.

00:21:35.550 --> 00:21:39.230
This city functions only as a test ground for extraterrestrials.

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:41.620
It is also a gravity-free zone on Earth.

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:47.090
It must be a penalty imposed by God.

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:49.410
Her physical appearance is off the scale,

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:52.510
so corrective measures were taken against her behavior.

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:56.620
I'll say it out loud,

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:59.330
in a clear and concise manner.

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:01.140
Ready, go.

00:22:01.140 --> 00:22:02.720
Fine.

00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:09.490
And so, I met Touwa Erio.

00:22:14.220 --> 00:22:18.770
I'll catch a cold, I'll catch a cold

00:22:18.770 --> 00:22:22.270
It's cold without my futon

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:26.860
It's cold if you rip it from me

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:31.320
You came at break of dawn

00:22:31.740 --> 00:22:35.120
With a smile on your face

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:45.170
I'm sure you think I can't see you

00:22:45.170 --> 00:22:49.550
You hold out your hand

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:54.260
What do you think you're doing?

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:59.020
I'll catch a cold, I'll catch a cold

00:23:01.480 --> 00:23:05.280
I pretend to sleep

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:09.200
And it gets a little warmer because of you

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:13.530
Next to me you lie, sleeping

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:21.540
And I ignore your sleepy murmurs

00:23:23.250 --> 00:23:30.510
I put a kiss on your eyebrows
